T*
(Machine \(PVM\).) Tj
T*
(* Variables are dynamic symbolic references, not statically typed storage boxes.) Tj
T*
(* Immutable types \(int, float, str, tuple\) cannot be altered in-place; mutable types) Tj
T*
(\(list, dict, set\) can.) Tj
T*
(* F-strings \(f'{var}'\) offer superior performance and readability for formatted) Tj
T*
(output.) Tj
T*
